     nnttpp..kkeeyyss — Network Time Protocol symmetric key format

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     nnttpp..kkeeyyss [----ooppttiioonn--nnaammee] [----ooppttiioonn--nnaammee _v_a_l_u_e]

